@startuml
title SEQ-10 — Upload de evidencia con owner genérico

' --- Configuración visual (Skinparams) Mejorada ---
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 16
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam BackgroundColor #F8F9FA

' Ocultar las etiquetas de los estereotipos para mantener un diseño limpio
hide stereotype

' --- Estilos base para Secuencia ---
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #34495E
  ArrowThickness 1.5
  LifeLineBorderColor #95A5A6
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  
  ParticipantBorderThickness 2
  ParticipantPadding 20
  
  ' Estilos de Grupos (alt/else)
  GroupHeaderFontColor #2C3E50
  GroupHeaderBackgroundColor #EAECEE
  GroupBorderColor #ABB2B9
  GroupBorderThickness 1.5
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

' --- Paleta de Colores Diferenciada por Componente ---
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor<<User>> #FDEDEC
  BorderColor<<User>> #E74C3C
  FontColor<<User>> #C0392B
}
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor<<Client>> #EAFAF1
  BorderColor<<Client>> #2ECC71
  FontColor<<Client>> #27AE60

  BackgroundColor<<Gateway>> #FEF9E7
  BorderColor<<Gateway>> #F1C40F
  FontColor<<Gateway>> #D4AC0D

  BackgroundColor<<Microservice>> #EBF5FB
  BorderColor<<Microservice>> #3498DB
  FontColor<<Microservice>> #2980B9
  
  ' Corrección: Los estilos de Storage se movieron a participant ya que "cloud" no es válido en secuencias
  BackgroundColor<<Storage>> #E8F8F5
  BorderColor<<Storage>> #1ABC9C
  FontColor<<Storage>> #16A085
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor<<RDBMS>> #F4ECF7
  BorderColor<<RDBMS>> #9B59B6
  FontColor<<RDBMS>> #8E44AD
}
skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor<<Queue>> #FDEBD0
  BorderColor<<Queue>> #E67E22
  FontColor<<Queue>> #D35400
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7D6
  BorderColor #A16207
  FontColor #2C3E50
}

' --- Declaración de Participantes con Iconos y Estereotipos ---
actor "<size:18><&person></size>\nUsuario" as Usuario <<User>>
participant "<size:18><&phone></size>\nWeb/Mobile" as C <<Client>>
participant "<size:18><&bolt></size>\nGateway" as Gateway <<Gateway>>
participant "<size:18><&document></size>\nMS-EVI" as EVI <<Microservice>>
database "<size:18><&hard-drive></size>\nevidence schema" as DB <<RDBMS>>
participant "<size:18><&cloud></size>\nMinIO/GCS" as OBJ <<Storage>>
queue "<size:18><&envelope-closed></size>\nRabbitMQ" as RabbitMQ <<Queue>>

' --- Lógica y Contenido Original ---
Usuario -> C : seleccionar cámara/galería/PDF
C -> C : prevalidar formato/tamaño + preview
C -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/evidences\nownerType + ownerId + multipart
Gateway -> EVI
EVI -> EVI : permiso + validar ownerType + MIME/magic bytes/size + SHA-256
EVI -> OBJ : store con objectKey interno
OBJ --> EVI : object/version id
EVI -> DB : BEGIN
EVI -> DB : INSERT evidence_metadata(owner_type, owner_id,...)
EVI -> DB : INSERT evidence.outbox_event(EvidenceUploaded)
EVI -> DB : COMMIT
EVI --> C : 201 EvidenceMetadata
... publisher outbox ...
EVI -> RabbitMQ : EvidenceUploaded

note right of EVI
Owner soportado: MOVEMENT, ASSET, ADJUSTMENT o REPORT.
ownerId es UUID externo sin FK cross-schema.
No se almacena BLOB en PostgreSQL.
end note
@enduml